{"date":"2025-03-23","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_5be832bbc2c848737239be61434b6d5b","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1742722200,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-03-20","chunk":0,"id":"m_6c756a2e6a1da3f786a16cfe7a20624a"}}},{"id":"m_036f8c9d8cb0e414e66c46ff68e5ecdd","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1742722237,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ae82f140354ebb1bfa3dd7d959169425","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1742722274,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fa6ee0f62c13352dffa06ee61e05592a","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1742722311,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6e4cf5773485f197aaedbeac9ff67121","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1742722348,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_839160f49d1517c7587562f6d16b1765","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1742722385,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a54dadaa2f786bfc402349a6f52352dd","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1742722422,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_2b386612197957f3cf08bc036872ac7b","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1742722459,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_55dc26aa26ff53300b240d4506569396","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1742722496,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fa16c78040a886c4720db8f99d77e69c","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1742722533,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4ee3838910229f73dabfe54f2c7e1706","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1742722570,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_a5bd468fb6d95217f6ae8923d174b4c7","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1742722607,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4affb2e113215f2b53cea604fa9ab9ac","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1742722644,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_20fa74998f0c8ee2e933053319ab250d","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1742722681,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9558c129d9d9e24d959cc3e9fd65ccef","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1742722718,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_db0a8c7d6d2bbac6d6ef10b518863816","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1742722755,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_39f38fc5201d01658282a023066b7c0e","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1742722792,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6ea14057b0b30a5a5647e6b25decd744","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1742722829,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7e3f3673fbe629b0a18e638d3ada0fd0","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1742722866,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_057d71b1a80ba4b2a4a3714f09d0770c","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1742722903,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fbef9cfd7f3ddbe4f66334fffc37cd17","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1742722940,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ca85be1a623e7b510a4a0f532cd8c6f5","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1742722977,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ab0f6b926c376998e0d5d8c2b01fddbd","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1742723014,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c3517da177a73cf524e432cbe1f552b9","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1742723051,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
